= Enrico Ferri

Ferri is a member of the <span style=" color:#DC143C">Maximalists</span> faction of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>. Having served as the editor of *Avanti!* and a criminologist, his primary influence is in writing.

